      "checkout_result_2026-09-20": "Failed 0, Errors 0, 770 tests in 6.7 s (node 24.3.0)"
    },
    "driving_protocol": "compile([\"loadLevel\", n], text, String(seed)); while (againing) { againing = false; processInput(-1); }; per action a in 0..4: processInput(a) then the same loop; NOOP (5): nothing. unitTesting = false so DoWin sets `winning` instead of calling nextLevel(). The episode ends at winning.",
    "rng": "rng.js RC4 keyed by the seed string (RandomGen = new RNG(seed) in loadLevelFromLevelDat); a falsy seed would fall back to Math.random() + Date.now(), so the seed is always a non-empty string",
    "parity": "lockstep: convertLevelToString(), sha1(level.objects), curlevel, winning, againing, textMode, messagetext, backups.length, movements all zero, RandomGen RC4 i/j/sha1(s) after reset and after every step (tests/gate_oracle.mjs vs tests/oracle.mjs on the unmodified checkout)",
    "not_matched": [
      "(filled in U03)"
    ]
  },
